cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite the study page it comes from (each folder's README row links it), or this repository as a whole."
type: dataset
title: "Mark Studios research data"
abstract: "Open per-row data behind 31 original studies published at https://www.markstudios.com/research: crawls of the 1,000 most-visited websites, YouTube Data API reads of large channels, SEC EDGAR counts of 10-K annual reports, English Wikipedia pageviews, App Store listings, USAspending.gov federal contract records (video production, advertising and public relations), GSA schedule labor rates, OPM federal workforce snapshots, and the own measurements behind several industry statistics pages. Each study page documents the method, validation and limitations."
authors:
  - name: "Mark Studios"
    website: "https://www.markstudios.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/markksantos/markstudios-research-data"
url: "https://www.markstudios.com/research"
keywords:
  - open data
  - web crawl
  - YouTube
  - SEC EDGAR
  - Wikipedia pageviews
  - video marketing
